<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><b>&#160;</b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">As of June 30, 2026, the Group&#8217;s cash balances
amounted to $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c1" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:CashAndCashEquivalents" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-9529">3,082,570</ix:nonFraction>, the current assets were $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c1" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:CurrentAssets" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-9530">22,574,038</ix:nonFraction>, and the current liabilities were $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c1" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:CurrentLiabilities" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-9531">10,698,455</ix:nonFraction>, resulting in a positive working
capital of $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c0" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:IncreaseDecreaseInWorkingCapital" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-9532">11,875,583</ix:nonFraction>. For the six months ended June 30, 2026, the Group incurred operating loss and loss for the period of $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c0" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:OperatingProfitLossOperating" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-9533">5,207,263</ix:nonFraction>
and $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c0" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:ProfitLoss" scale="0" sign="-" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-9534">7,062,813</ix:nonFraction>, respectively with net operating cash outflows of $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c0" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:CashFlowsFromUsedInOperatingActivities" scale="0" sign="-" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-9535">10,988,904</ix:nonFraction>. As the continuous net losses and significant operating cash
outflow, there is material uncertainty that may cast significant doubt on the Group&#8217;s ability to continue as a going concern.</p>

