<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-left: 0.5in; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt">The balance as of December 31, 2025 represents a loan from a third party amounting to S$<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c2" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:OtherPayables" scale="0" unitRef="sgd" id="ixv-9696">650,000</ix:nonFraction> equalling to $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c132" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:OtherPayables" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-9697">506,191</ix:nonFraction> which is interest-bearing at <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c132" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="yfor:PercentageOfOtherPayablesInterestBearingPerAnnum" scale="-2" unitRef="pure" id="ixv-9698">8</ix:nonFraction>% per annum and repayable on demand. &#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt">&#160;</p>

<ix:continuation id="yfor_ScheduleOfTradeAndOtherPayablesTableTextBlock-c0_cont_2"><table cellpadding="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; width: 100%; border-spacing: 0px;"><tr style="vertical-align: top; text-align: justify">
<td style="width: 0.5in"/><td style="width: 0.25in; text-align: left">**</td><td style="text-align: justify"><ix:footnote id="ix_4_footnote" xml:lang="en-US">The amount represents non-trade balances that are unsecured,
interest-free and repayable on demand.</ix:footnote></td>
</tr></table></ix:continuation></ix:nonNumeric><div>


