<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 1in; text-align: justify">The CODM evaluates operating segments
based on revenue and Segment profit/(loss). <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c0" continuedAt="_DisclosureOfProfitLossFromOperatingActivitiesExplanatory-c0_cont_1" escape="true" name="ifrs-full:DisclosureOfProfitLossFromOperatingActivitiesExplanatory" id="ixv-10264">Total revenue for reportable segments equals consolidated revenue for the Group. Segment (loss)/profit
is defined as net profit or loss of each operating segment excluding the unallocated overhead cost.</ix:nonNumeric></p>

